# run-pix-passes.py recreates work/<build>/ on every run: a compiled module, a deliberately
# broken copy of it used as the verifier control, and a private copy of dxopt.exe paired with
# each release's dxcompiler.dll. All derived, none of it evidence -- the numbers taken from it
# are in manual-case-*.txt. Ignored rather than committed for the reason SKILL.md gives on
# #2427: the script creates the directory itself, so nothing depends on git storing an empty
# one, and the copied DLLs are release binaries that do not belong in this tree.
work/
